. 
. * FILTERS * 
. 
.         *Only keep participants who:
.         *(1) have children
.         *(2) have one child only (dropped once second child arrives). Twins/M
> ultiplets counted as 'having daughter' if at least one of them is a girl 
.         *(3) use last year of panel where we have full information (but secon
> d child has not arrived yet!)
. 
.         use "$DATA/h3_dataset.dta", clear 

.         
.                 *(1a) Keep only participants who have children:
.                 fre kidgeb01

